    {
      "id": "u_65649dae28c8bc8c7682e8b1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To keep links readable regardless of the theme, the default hyperlink color applied automatically by word processors is ignored; links that were deliberately given a custom color by the author keep it.",
      "sourceHash": "65649dae28c8bc8c7682e8b1c3e06ed696021a8d5b274b04f125945943290c65",
      "context": "Office documents > How it works",
      "contextHash": "6957858acc9592116275180ce571371c6e66c3178db8ef5f7d2974492f912807",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Office documents > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "90176f447878c483f6fc7e412bb7010a9f9e09eb631447bf6b6834550dac609e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_570a1fe1e5db86b71ab80912_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The preview is read-only. To edit the document, download it or open it in an external application; the content of the note is not affected by the preview. Alternatively copy and paste it into a text note.",
      "sourceHash": "570a1fe1e5db86b71ab80912017e0f100135eb5607568ac4641f04c48161121c",
      "context": "Office documents > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "90176f447878c483f6fc7e412bb7010a9f9e09eb631447bf6b6834550dac609e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_12544adf98e2adccb54eeb0b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The preview is a simplified rendering: complex layouts (columns, text boxes, headers and footers), charts and the precise styling of table borders are not reproduced.",
      "sourceHash": "12544adf98e2adccb54eeb0b799062d1db19015875b9fa94e90d55deb5c5c31a",
      "context": "Office documents > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "90176f447878c483f6fc7e412bb7010a9f9e09eb631447bf6b6834550dac609e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c970d9c090601af5ffd2020f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Documents larger than 20 MB are not previewed, to keep the server responsive. The usual download and open actions remain available.",
      "sourceHash": "c970d9c090601af5ffd2020fa53058775da8e7b730ceb57d447553fedadda9f2",
      "context": "Office documents > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "90176f447878c483f6fc7e412bb7010a9f9e09eb631447bf6b6834550dac609e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bb9a8531c9bbdf46b7f088a2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If the document cannot be converted, a notice is displayed instead and the file can still be downloaded or opened externally.",
      "sourceHash": "bb9a8531c9bbdf46b7f088a2fcb1fcb268d940b122ef9c76a612e511d5960702",
      "context": "Office documents > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "90176f447878c483f6fc7e412bb7010a9f9e09eb631447bf6b6834550dac609e",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_43285c859cd46a09fd387045_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Relation with other features__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "43285c859cd46a09fd3870459a32352c646ffe1698d500127707ee51f3896b7e",
      "context": "Office documents > Relation with other features",
      "contextHash": "bfa77ece066590f79cc412962027835c94f3d5bc9863efbb78966c37484976d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_39b8e243204f65b1b1e7f3af_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The same preview is used when an office document is displayed in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note List__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or embedded in a text note via __TRILIUM_PH_2__Include Note__TRILIUM_PH_3__, as well as for office documents stored as __TRILIUM_PH_4__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "39b8e243204f65b1b1e7f3af089ed929c5f8a6bf321fd0156328823b1712c334",
      "context": "Office documents > Relation with other features",
      "contextHash": "bfa77ece066590f79cc412962027835c94f3d5bc9863efbb78966c37484976d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bd3fc21bd1a23a7f16fcadbb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Independently of the preview, the text content of office documents is also extracted in the background so that it can be found with __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ via __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text Extraction (OCR)__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "bd3fc21bd1a23a7f16fcadbb6a8c8cdb2c2f624db0d0a25af372a11528d52ad7",
      "context": "Office documents > Relation with other features",
      "contextHash": "bfa77ece066590f79cc412962027835c94f3d5bc9863efbb78966c37484976d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c02b296cf4e5049e18e26da9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ files can be converted to __TRILIUM_PH_2__Spreadsheets__TRILIUM_PH_3__ via the __TRILIUM_PH_4__import__TRILIUM_PH_5__ function.",
      "sourceHash": "c02b296cf4e5049e18e26da9d21a61dc58cea6b419cf8fe486962839281a7e75",
      "context": "Office documents > Relation with other features",
      "contextHash": "bfa77ece066590f79cc412962027835c94f3d5bc9863efbb78966c37484976d4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
